# Play release (fastlane). The lanes and the listing ARE tracked -
# fastlane/metadata/android/ is also the layout F-Droid reads. What must never
# be committed is the local tooling and every piece of signing material.
/Makefile_fastlane
/fastlane.md
/play-store-config.json
*.jks
*.keystore
/upload_certificate.pem
/playconsole/
/fastlane/report.xml
/fastlane/README.md
/vendor/bundle/
